    ,                             !- zone cooling sizing factor
    Flow/Area,                    !- Outdoor Air Method
    ,                             !- outdoor air flow rate per person
    0.000508;                     !- Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Zone Floor Area {m3/s-m2}  Source: xlsx Zone and HVAC System Summary Q7 (Total OSA Ventilation, 20 cfm/person) x N7 (Design Occupancy Density, 5.000 people per 1000 ft2) = 0.1000 cfm/ft2 = 0.000508 m3/s-m2 (1 cfm/ft2 = 0.00508 m3/s-m2).

